    {
      "id": "k46myje",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": "SSC / SSC Important Exam Notes"
    },
    {
      "type": "pullQuote",
      "content": "Article 32 is the very soul of the Constitution and the very heart of it.",
      "id": "5g0ads6"
    },
    {
      "type": "keyFacts",
      "title": "Key Takeaways",
      "items": [
        "Article 14 guarantees equality before law and equal protection of the laws within the territory of India.",
        "Article 21 protects life and personal liberty, which includes the Right to Education under Article 21A.",
        "Article 32 confers the right to move the Supreme Court for enforcement of Fundamental Rights.",
        "Article 356 allows for the imposition of President's Rule in states during failure of constitutional machinery.",
        "Article 368 details the power of Parliament to amend the Constitution and procedure thereof."
      ],
      "id": "80cefxb"
    },
