      "type": "examAlert",
      "items": [
        "Article 17 (Abolition of Untouchability) is one of the most frequently asked questions in SSC and State PSC exams.",
        "Difference between Article 32 (Supreme Court writs) and Article 226 (High Court writs) is a crucial topic for competitive exams.",
